            <ArticleTitle>Colo-ovarian fistula.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>rjx228</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1093/jscr/rjx228</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Colo-ovarian fistula is a rare entity. The case of a 54-year-old female with a colo-ovarian fistula is presented. We describe our experience in managing this complication of diverticulitis and propose a workup and treatment plan. Initial imaging and diagnostic studies are described. En-bloc resection of the sigmoid colon and ovary was performed. A review of the literature is presented.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
